-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 002_assets.sql — asset tree, devices, tags, alarm rules, shift templates
--
-- A small water utility: two districts with pumping stations, a reservoir,
-- a water-quality station, a weather station and a monitored bridge.
--
-- Fixed, readable ids (valid UUID v4) so later seed files can reference them:
--   assets 10000000-…, devices 20000000-…, tags 30000000-…,
--   alarm rules 40000000-…, shift templates 50000000-…
-- Re-running is safe: every INSERT ends in ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

